WEBVTT

27:34.721 --> 27:37.265
- Where's the Imp?
- Will you shut up?

27:37.390 --> 27:38.892
ROBERT: Who have we here?

27:40.268 --> 27:41.603
You must be Robb.

27:44.564 --> 27:46.691
My, you're a pretty one.

27:48.109 --> 27:49.986
Your name is?

27:50.111 --> 27:51.488
Arya.

27:52.697 --> 27:55.283
Oh, show us your muscles.

27:56.618 --> 27:58.912
(CHUCKLES) You'll be a soldier.
